	)
	(text "CSI signals are MIPI differential pairs. \nYou cannot treat these like standard 1-to-1 DC connections.\nTo ensure the OV3660 camera actually streams:\n\n1. Group the Pairs: On your PCB, keep the data lines together as pairs (e.g., Pin 2 & 3, Pin 5 & 6).\n\n2. Differential Impedance: The traces between the two connectors should be routed as 100 Ohm differential pairs.\n\n3. Ground Islation: Ensure there is a solid ground plane on the layer directly beneath these traces. \n	The ground pins (Pins 1, 4, 7, etc.) should be stitched to this plane immediately to act as a shield between the high-speed lanes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -137.16 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "eb414c73-9874-4745-bcf8-5496ffd54dfa")
	)
